 ## Proof
 
+- `TestMemoryPoolsKeepRowsAcrossDefaultExpiry` uses real SQLite databases and accelerates positive default expiry to 10 milliseconds. All eight memory DSN forms retain their rows after that boundary.
+- `TestPersistentPoolsKeepTimedEviction` verifies finite persistent defaults and row survival after a real connection expires.
+- `TestPoolOptionsFoldInOrder` checks later overrides, zero fields and negative fields.
+- `TestPoolIdleLimitClosesExtraConnection`, `TestPoolLifetimeClosesExpiredConnection` and `TestPoolIdleTimeClosesExpiredConnection` observe each setting through physical connection statistics.
+- `TestInTxHonorsCallerCancellationBeforeCommit` checks the exact context error and verifies rollback leaves no inserted row.
+
 - `TestDialectOfMatchesEachDriverName` proves the four driver names.
 - `TestOpenRejectsUnknownDriver` and `TestOpenRejectsMysqlWithoutParseTime` prove the two open refusals.
 - `TestDialectOfRejectsParseTimeInThePassword` proves that `parseTime=true` outside the query part does not count.
